  m_Text: 'Spell layer held: the four spells on the face buttons (keys: 1 to 4)

    Spell layer tapped on a pad: the surge

    Heavy held: the charged heavy

    Heavy on a staggered enemy: finisher

    Weapon skill: costs mana

    Flask held: throw it, once learned'
